# Hidden Truth (Q021), played by a level 63 character: the mysterious wizard starts it; the
# tombstone wakes the duke's ghost (far away, out of sight; a second call finds it there); the
# duke calls his page, whose walk ends 9.5 s later and marks end_walk; the bookshelf drops a
# book, the player learns the truth, and the page is sent away; the bookshelf gives the cross of
# Einhasad; the three priests each see it, the third moving the quest on; Innocentin swaps the
# cross for the one of the next quest and the quest completes. Expectations come from the
# reference trace (Q021_HiddenTruth.java, Quest.addSpawn, QuestState.setCond).
